Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.83,0:01:35.93,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Mama...Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.78,0:01:44.58,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,They're beautiful, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:51.48,def2,CHIAKI,0,0,0,,Yes, and when you grow older, I wish for you to become a gentle person like these flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.19,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:13.43,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(928,660)}April 20th, 2193 A.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.54,0:02:12.88,def2,CHIAKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:24.61,def2,CHIAKI,0,0,0,,This world is too cruel.\N I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:26.08,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Mama !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:29.20,def2,CHIAKI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:37.33,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}My mother was gentle and fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:44.35,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If gentleness and humanity can\N kill people, I'd rather abandon it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:02.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Comet Empire has reached \Nthe Mars final defense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:04.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{teki}The number of enemy ships has\N passed 20,000, and is still increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:09.33,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,BBB squadron executed a short warp into the Comet's interior, but we lost contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:11.84,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Comet Empire is maintaining its speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:17.23,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,It's not like they have infinite war potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:22.98,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,If we use the wave motion fleet to reduce \Ntheir numbers, we have a chance for victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.35,def2,TODO,0,0,0,,Any update on the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:27.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,According to a report from the Yamanami fleet, which rescued some of the crew members...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:31.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{suisei}...there's no additional information after the ship fell into the interior of the Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{suisei} I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.87,0:03:35.78,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Say what ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.73,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A safety device.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:46.92,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,If what it says is true, the Zemurians must have made\N a safety device to permanently shut down the Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:54.27,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Answer me.\N I brought you here to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:56.53,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:58.70,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}We can't tell outsiders...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:00.14,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:06.02,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,As the last Zemurian I demand the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.94,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}It sings the song of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:13.01,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's a yoke, and the most significant key...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:14.39,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...for controlling the Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.41,0:04:17.36,def2,KIDS,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's called{\c&H00FF00&} Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:19.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Golem...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:24.38,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}The Zemurians built it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:28.08,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Once activated, it will bring\N death to all artificial humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:33.58,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Zorder swiftly took it when the revolt began...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.58,0:04:36.52,def2,Girl,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...but he couldn't destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:41.59,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{hakai}As soon as Golem is damaged, it begins to sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.23,0:04:46.73,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...the song of destruction which will kill man-made cells...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:48.58,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{ucyuu}...that echoes through the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:51.05,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,So Golem still exists ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.57,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Where is it now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.91,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Analyzer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.17,0:04:59.28,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,They figured it out. {not sure what he's implying, but maybe has a hidden motive}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.05,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Lost the link at a time like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:04.26,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,We still don't know the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:06.04,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:12.83,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,Golem is in the hands of the Great Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:16.98,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,They know too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:21.73,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We have to sacrifice a planet\N in order to seize Earth anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:24.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Destroy Zemuria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:32.27,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Are you leading me into this, Teresa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:52.89,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What is it ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.91,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,A planet-wide tectonic shift{crustal movement} has started !{ broken out !}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:57.38,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,All hands, to your posts !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:05:59.06,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Prepare to launch the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:33.29,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Why don't you attack already ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.14,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Orders from Defense HQ to all fleets !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:42.80,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{tettei}Hold out no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:44.41,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Maintain the defense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.49,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{ichinichi}Holding for one day means \Nwe can send reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:53.23,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{futsuka}The size doubles in two days, \Nand it'll be even greater in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:57.28,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{jikan}As long as we have the Time Fault,\N our war potential is unlimited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:00.57,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{hirumu}Don't be scared. Fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:05.30,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{chikyu}For Earth, and for the future of our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:11.61,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{warera}We must not let our civilization,\Nor the human species go extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:20.18,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{ikinobiru}Survive regardless of the cost,\Nno matter how bad things get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:32.38,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}A.I. operated autonomous control...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:35.10,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'm the only crewman, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:44.91,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's sad, don't you think so too, Andromeda ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:08.25,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Three Medalusa-class ships destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.78,def2,FOMT,0,0,0,,We're just getting started !\N Keep pushing  !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:18.03,def2,BALSEY,0,0,0,,Rotate the catapult !\N Launch the Desvatators !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:36.05,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A large number of spacecraft have\N launched from a massive enemy carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:39.42,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire rapid torpedoes and cluster missiles...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:42.98,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,{tsuzukete}...followed by a barrage of graviton spread shots !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.98,0:08:43.78,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,{tsuzukete}Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.10,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Message from the Aldebaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:08.73,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We'll hold this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:12.88,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Break apart the shield and\N withdraw to the other side of Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:16.14,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,No, for the honor of Garmillas, we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.50,0:09:19.70,def2,TANI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Another fleet is coming, directly from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.16,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare to fire wave motion guns !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.91,0:10:01.78,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.92,0:10:21.21,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Take off as{when} the ground gives way.{Use the crumble of the ground to take off.}{???}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:23.41,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Starting the auxiliary engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:29.19,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Now, Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.19,0:10:30.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Raise the hull !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.26,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,High energy signature{body}, incoming !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:54.08,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Launch the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:14.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Get into communications range no matter\N what, and inform Earth about Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Engine, maximum output !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.21,0:11:34.33,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}This is no longer a matter of Earth or Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:39.57,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{jikan}As long as the Time Fault exists, \Nthe killing will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:52.69,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I thought I'd chosen the best\N option to restore Earth, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:07.83,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If only I could destroy the gravitational core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:14.95,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why are they destroying their own planet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:23.43,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,What ?\N Say it again !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:29.48,def2,AI,0,0,0,,{The losses of the Earth and Garmillas\N joint forces has exceeded 50%. } The losses of the Earth-Garmillas\N joint forces have exceeded 50%
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:32.22,def2,AI,0,0,0,,This ship will not return to combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:40.63,def2,AI,0,0,0,,HQ ordered us to proceed with Plan G. \NI will partially assume command of this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.61,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We're under an A.I.'s command ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this ? \NWhat's Plan G ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:55.48,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The Time Fault can produce weapons\N endlessly, but humans have a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:59.58,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,The solutions are to reduce \Npersonnel by using A.I.s...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:03.78,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,...and raise weapon usage\N efficiency by modifying human bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:11.48,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,We don't know what kind of choices \Nhumans will have to make in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:17.17,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,That's why we preserve normal genes \Nwhile we can, and when the worst comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:22.81,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,"...we leave Earth to look for a new home."\N Is that Plan G ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:24.18,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,But how ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:29.98,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,Even if we have reproductive cells, \Nit's not easy to produce humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.02,def2,KAORU,0,0,0,,The ship is not equipped with such a lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:37.43,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Correct. That's why most of the\N Ginga crew members are female.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:42.72,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,Artificial reproduction will \Neventually become real, but for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.63,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,We're humanity's last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:49.22,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,Even if we mechanize\N our limbs, the body is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.51,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,In order for humans to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.51,0:13:54.51,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Do we have to go that far ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:14:00.92,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,In order to overcome fear, \Nyou must become fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:05.49,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...such as the wave motion gun fleet and military expansion with the Time Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:12.23,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,It was mankind's decision after the\N devastation of the war with Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:16.92,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{kono}{It's in order to live in this cruel world,\Nsince humans are too weak.}It's in order to live on in this cruel world,\N since humans are too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:22.35,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}From Andromeda to all ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.94,0:14:23.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Do you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.98,0:14:25.20,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I found the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.60,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,It was very brief, but I was\N able to visually detect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:32.88,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,It was the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.16,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,The Yamato is alive !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.81,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:42.27,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}But it's caught in the \NComet Empire's massive gravitational field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:45.80,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's impossible for the Yamato to break free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:50.79,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{zanzon}Remaining ships, if you hear me,\N help the Yamato escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:59.46,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,This ship will approach the center of the Comet, and\N attempt to destroy the gravitational core of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.33,0:15:07.38,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,That's suicide !\NThe Andromeda is by itself with no escort !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:13.02,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,On top of that, the Andromeda alone can't hold out\N against the gravitational core that controls so much mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.99,0:15:16.58,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Captain, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Ginga's Cosmo Reverse\N can amplify wave motion guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:24.53,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{Andromeda}{The Andromeda alone should be\N able to damage the gravitational core.}The Andromeda alone should then be\N able to damage the gravitational core.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:33.88,def2,AI,0,0,0,,The CRS will be over-stressed in\N order to obtain the expected results.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:39.09,def2,AI,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose the Cosmo Reverse System for an uncertain operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:40.49,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,I didn't ask {\i1}your{\i0} opinion !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:45.77,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.89,0:15:53.74,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,So many lives have been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:58.13,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,I can't claim responsibility for it anymore, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:07.98,def2,YAMANAMI...take,0,0,0,,...take the Andromeda and my life,\N so you can come home, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:08.91,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Yamanami...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:14.00,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No dead person can take responsibility, Yamanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:19.49,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Live...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:23.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,...live and dust yourself off.{ bite the dust.???}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:27.24,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,No matter how humiliating it is, survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:35.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Humans are weak, and make mistakes. \NWhat's wrong with that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.53,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We are not...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:39.66,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,...machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.67,def2,AI,0,0,0,,Plan G must be prioritized...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.67,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Machines don't feel shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.81,def2,AI,0,0,0,,...for the survival of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:52.38,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Humility and mistakes make humans special.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:54.92,def2,AI,0,0,0,,This ship must immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.38,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,Captain !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:03.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The Command A.I. is recalled as of now !\N I'm assuming command of this ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:07.38,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Troubleshoot A-7, system rebooted !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.86,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Take the Ginga to the Mars combat zone !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:33.91,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Rapid torpedoes, fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.67,0:17:44.45,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,You're a tough one, Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the wave motion gun !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.18,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Captain Yamanami, take me with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.63,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,...so we both can survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.08,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(958,580)}Ginga
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:27.60,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,Cosmo Reverse, running at maximum capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:31.92,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,This shot will render it useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:37.09,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,That's fine.\N This is our ship, a human one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:45.68,def2,URARA,0,0,0,,Amplification rate 8 million TPa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.98,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Activate the Cosmo Reverse !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:54.82,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire the wave motion gun !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.15,0:19:34.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I can't steer !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.96,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Three seconds till shock-wave passage !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:38.77,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Engine, maximum output !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:40.08,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:52.75,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Zemuria has been destroyed !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:05.23,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,Forced contact of rocket anchors !\N We're being pulled !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:10.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That's the Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:19.48,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,All ships, leave the White Comet !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:56.58,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,The Andromeda's heavily damaged ! \NIt's critical !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:04.65,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:11.99,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You're alive...\NYou're really alive !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:18.10,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Black Birds, launch all spacecraft and \Ndefend the Yamato and Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:19.64,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,Roger !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.42,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,We're done for, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:39.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.58,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}This is Kato of the Black Birds. \NDo you copy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:21.25,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Reporting the successful \Nrescue of Captain Yamanami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.88,0:22:24.88,def2,KATO,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I repeat. \NCaptain Yamanami, successfully rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:45.21,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.78,0:22:45.21,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(310,1044)}Escape from Nightmare !!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:18.48,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cottony clouds drift high across the sky\N{\i1}Sora takaku nagareru kieyuku wata no kumo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:31.24,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Holding out both hands, I stretch out in the falling leaves\N{\i1}Ryoote wo age ah senobi shita rakuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:51.54,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}As the house lights come on, I wish to meet people smiling at each other\N{\i1}Akari tomoru mado waraiau hito ni aitai to omou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:24:05.67,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Believing in a miraculous enounter{meeting} to become real, I shout out for love\N{\i1}Sou kanau hazusa kiseki no deai ni ai sakenda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:25.63,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Luminous lives meet and bond with each other\N{\i1}Kagayaku jinsei no meguriawase tsumuideyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:41.66,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s keep on living our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei wo tayumazu ni susumi tsuzukeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:25:02.28,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s begin the story of our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei no monogatari wo saa hajimeyou
