Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.78,0:25:34.23,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.94,0:25:37.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Can we talk to Zorder one more time ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.04,0:25:39.40,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,{Tell me how to break free from the puppeteer.}Tell me, how does one break\N free from the puppeteer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.40,0:25:41.51,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,There's only one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.51,0:25:44.61,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,No enemy contact, \Nexcept for one, the Neues Deusula.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.61,0:25:46.94,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Keep going. Crash into it !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:47.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 22
